        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since our inception, we have devoted substantial resources to the development of our lead product candidate, Deramiocel, a cell therapy designed to address the cardiac and skeletal muscle complications associated with DMD, as well as to advancing our exosome-based platform, developing manufacturing capabilities and supporting our research and development activities.",
